WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:05.115
Every app on your Mac is talking to the internet. All the time.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.955
And most of it, you never get to see.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:13.890
Reqly lets you look inside. Every request, every response, as it happens.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.535
See which app sent each request, and where it went.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:24.095
Read the headers, the cookies, and the full body, neatly formatted.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:26.985
And see exactly where the time went.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.215
Pause a request, change it, then let it go.

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.310
Try your app on a slow connection.

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:38.300
Rewrite traffic with a few lines of JavaScript.

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:40.715
Connect your iPhone, or a simulator.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:44.535
HTTP/2, WebSockets, and gRPC.

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:47.290
Save a session, and share it with your team.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:51.925
Reqly is free, open source, and made for the Mac.

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:54.710
And your traffic stays on your Mac.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:58.420
See what your apps send and receive.
